<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 TI - Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri MuchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">1Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuna 1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba Rokuthanga RaPhauro Kuna</para>
  <para style="mt1">1TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba rokuthanga raTimoti ndimwe romatsamba yadonyohwa noNhumwa Phauro kumudzidzi wache Timoti. Tsamba rakareri rokuthanga raTimoti rinofungidzihwa kuti ridonyohwa pakati pomakore makumi matanhatu nomairi kusvika pamakumi matanhutu nomanai mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Nguwa yakarei inogona kunge yaiva yokurarama kwokupedzisira hwaPhauro. Iye Phauro wanga achijidzana zvidonyanya naTimoti, zvokutomuita mwana wache. (Vafiripi 2:22. 1 Timoti 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba irori ndimwe romatsamba manai yadonyohwa naPhauro ndokutumihwa kumunhu kusiri kuKherekhe. Yamwe matsamba matatu njaya, 2 Timoti, Tito naFirimoni. Muna 1 Timoti muno kuraihwa kudowanda pamusoro pokunamatiwa kwaMwari muKherekhe. (1 Timoti 2:1-15). Kutungamira Kherekhe kudokodzera (1 Timoti 3:1-18), noyambiro pamusoro podzidziso dzomabhwodo pakare (1 Timoti 1:3-11, 4:1-5, 6:2-5). Zvakarezvi zvinonangidza madzidzisiro yaPhauro yaaiita kumwana wache Timoti kuti ave mutungamiri womaKherekhe. 1 Timoti inozvidzidzo zvidowanda zvinogona kubatsira vatungamiri vokherekhe yomazuva yatiri, kuti vakwanise kuita ushumiri hunobudirira mumakherekhe yavari.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga nokumoresa Timoti (1 Timoti 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzopasa Timoti yambiro pamusoro povadzidzisi vomabhwodo (1 Timoti 1:3-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anoenderera mberi achitsanangura kutendendero yaanoita Jesu Khirisitu (1 Timoti 1:12-19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mozvakarezvo Phauro anoraira Timoti pamusoro pokunamata Mwari nopamusoro povatungamiri vokherekhe (1Timoti 2—3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anodzopedzisa tsamba rache achipasa Timoti kuraira kwokupedzisira (1Timoti 4:1—6:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Kubva kuna Phauro, Nhumwa yaKhirisitu Jesu nokuraira kwaMwari Muponisi wedu nokwaKhirisitu Jesu tariro yedu.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Kuna Timoti, mwana wangu wochokwadi pakutenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Mutsa, notsitsi, norunyararo zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba naKhirisitu Jesu Ishe wedu mbazvive kwauri.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo Pamusoro Podzidziso Yomabhwodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Sezvandidokukurudzira pandanga ndichienda kuMasedhoniya, ramba uri muEfeso kuti uraire vamwe vanhu kuti varekerefuti kufundisa dzidziso imwewo idosiyana, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />kana kuva vanoramba vari muzvinzano nomadzinza yasingapere zvinosumudzira kupesana pachinzvimbo chokuendesa mberi basa raMwari rinouya nokutenda. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Chinangwa chokuraira kwedu rudo rinobva pamwoyo udochena, hana idonaka nokutenda kudoperera. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Vamwe vadotaika panozvakarezvi vachiteterekera pakunyaira zvisinai nonzeru dzese. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Vanoda kuva vadzididzisi vomutemo, asi ivo vasinganzvitsitse zvavanonyaira kana zvinhu zvavanosimbisa.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Zvino tinoziva kuti mutemo udonaka, kana munhu achiushandisa zviri pamutemo, <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />tichinzvitsitsa zvakarezvi, kuti mutemo haunai kuitihwa vadorurama asi vomhunzva novapanduki, vasingache Mwari novatadzi, vasiri vatsvene novoutsambwa, vanopunza anababa novanopunza nanamai, vanobaya vanhu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />mhombo, ngochani, vanopamba vanhu, vanyepi, novaiti vozvimwewo zvinopikisana nodzidziso idonaka, <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />iri maererano novhangeri rokubhwinya raMwari adoropafadziwa, randidovimbiwa naro.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda Nondava Yotsitsi dzaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Ndinomutenda iye adondipasa simba rozvakarezvi, Khirisitu Jesu Ishe wedu, ndava adoona ndidovimbika ndokundipasa basa rache, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />kunyange zvazvene ndidothanga ndichishora Mwari nokumutambudza nokuita mungu, asi adondiitira tsitsi ndava ndidozviita mukusaziva nomukusatenda. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Asi mutsa dzaIshe wedu dzidoduruhwa pandiri pabodzi nokutenda norudo zviri muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Kunyaira ndokwochokwadi futi kunofanira kutambihwa, kwokuti Khirisitu Jesu adouya munyika kudzoponesa vatadzi. Inipano ndiri adokungudza wacho. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Asi ndidoitihwa tsitsi nondava yakarei, kuti mandiri iyeni mutadzi adokungudza, Jesu Khirisitu anangidze mwoyo murefu wache zvichiva muenzaniso kuno vaye vanodzotenda kwaari kuti vave noupenyu husingapere. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Kuna Mambo wonguwa dzese, asingapfe, asingaoneke, Mwari wega mubodzi, mbakuve nokuremekedzewa nokubhwinya nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoti, mwanakomana wangu, ndinokutsindikira zvinoenderana nokunyaira kwozvidoporofitiwa pamusoro pako, kuti nokufemehwa nazvo uhwe hondo idonaka, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />udobatirira kutenda nohana idonaka, zvinova zvidorambiwa novamwe, vachibva vambwedza kutenda kwavo. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Pakati pavo pana Haimenasi naArekizanda, vandidodzopereka kuna Sathani kuti vadzidze kuti Mwari haashorewe.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Vanhu Vese Mbavanamatihwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Saka, pakuthanga kwozvese ndinokurudzira kuti vanhu vese vakumbirihwe, vanamatihwe, vateterehwe, futi vatendehwe, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />zviitihwewo madzimambo novese vari muutungamiri, kuti tigare upenyu hunorunyararo, hunoumwari pakare hudoremekedzeka mumitoo yese. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Zvakarezvi zvidonaka, futi zvinofadza Mwari Muponisi wedu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />iye anoda kuti vanhu vese vaponesewe futi kuti vasvike pakuziva chokwadi. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Ndava kuna Mwari mubodzi, futi kuno mumiririri mubodzi pakati paMwari novanhu, munhu Khirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />iye adozvipa semuripo wokuripira vanhu vese, upfakazi hwozvakarezvi hudopiwa panguwa idokodzera. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Nondava yakarei ndidosaruriwa kuva muparidzi nonhumwa nomudzidzisi wovasiri vaJudha. Ndiri kunyaira chokwadi handibhwodoke.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Saka ndinoda kuti kunzvimbo dzese varume vanamate vadosumudza manja yavo matsvene, vasinai ukari kana kupikisana. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Futi vanhukadzi mbavasimire zvidotsiga, zvidoremekedzeka futi zvidokodzera, vasinai kurukhiwa misoro kana kusimira zvipfeko zvondarama kana chuma kana zvipfeko zvinodhura <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />asi kuva nounhu hudonaka, hudofanira kuitiwa novanhukadzi vanoti tinonamata Mwari. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Vanhukadzi mbavadzidze vadonyarara futi vachizvidukupisa. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Ndinobvumiraba kuti munhukadzi afundise kana kuti ave nosimba rinokunda romunhurume, munhukadzi mbaanyarare. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Ndava Adhamu adothanga kuumbiwa, ndokudzouyawo Evha. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Futi Adhamu haanai kufurihwa, asi munhukadzi adofurihwa achibva wava mutadzi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Zvidodaipo munhukadzi achaponesewa nondava yokuzvara vana, kana akaramba ari mukutenda nomurudo nomuutsvene, nounhu hudodzikama.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Vatungamiri woKherekhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Uku kunyaira kwochokwadi, Wese anoda kuita mutungamiri, anoda basa ridonaka. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Manje mutariri anofanira kuva asinai chinoshoreka, mbaave murume ano mukadzi mubodzi, munyoro, anozvidzora, anoremekedzeka, anogamuchira varendo, futi anokona kufundisa, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />aikona anokorewa, aikona anoita botso asi munyoro, asingaite zvobopoto, futi mbaave asingaditse mari. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Anofanira kuva anokwanisa kudzora mhuri yache zvidonaka, nokuva nochokwadi chokuti vana vache vanoteerera, futi vanokuremekedza kwese, <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />ndava kana iye asingagone kutungamirira mhuri yache, angadzokona tini kutungamirira kherekhe yaMwari? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Anofaniraba kuva mutendi mutsva, nondava yokuti anodzozvikudza wopinda mukutongewa pabodzi najabhurosi. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Futi anofanira kupupurihwa zvidonaka novanhu vokunze, kuti areke kudzopinda pakunyadzisiwa nomuriva rajabhurosi.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vabatsiri Mukherekhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Nzvibodzibodziwo novabatsiri vomukherekhe, mbavave vanoremekedzeka, vanorevesa, vasingakorewe nowaini, novasingatizirire kupfuma. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Vanofanira kuramba vadobatitsitsa nomwoyo udoperera chokwadi chidohwanzika chokutenda. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Vanofanira kuthanga vaongororewa, kana pasinai chinovatadzisa, mbavaite basa rokubatsira. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Ndomwenzewo vakadzi vavo mbavave vanoremekedzeka, vareke guhwa, asi vave vadokodzera, futi vadotendeka pazvinhu zvese. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Mubatsiri mbaave murume womukadzi mubodzi, futi mbavave vanoraira vana vavo nokubata misha yavo zvidonaka. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Ndava vese vanoshanda zvidonaka pabasa rokubatsira vanopembedzewa uye vadojirichira pakutenda kwavo muna Khirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chidosvisvika Chikuru Chokutenda Kwedu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ndino tarisiro yokuuya kwauri nokamangu, asi ndiri kunyora kuraira uku kwauri kuti, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />kana ndikachehwa, uzive unhu hudonaka hunoitiwa muimba yaMwari, inova kherekhe yaMwari mupenyu, ndiro bango nonheyo yochokwadi. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Pasinai kupokana chidosvisvika choumwari chatinopupura chikuru chaizvo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">adooneka mumuviri wonyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">adoruramisiwa paMweya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">adoonewa nongirozi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">adoparidziwa pakati pomarudzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">adotendewa panyika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">futi adotohwa kuenda mukubhwinya.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Vadzidzisi Vomabhwodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Manje Mweya anotaura zviri pachenu kuti panguwa yokupedzisira vamwe vachatsambuka vachisiya nzira yokutenda vachitevera mweya inofurira futi vachitevera kudzidzisa kwomashave, <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />kudzidzisa kwakareku kunouya nounyengeri hwovanyepi, vanohana dzinenge dzidopisiwa nosimbi inopisa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Vakareva vanorambidza kuroorana nokuja zvimwe zvidosikiwa naMwari kuti zvitambiriwe nokutenda noavo vanoziva chokwadi. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Ndava chese chidosikiwa naMwari chidonaka, futi hapanai chinofanira kurambiwa kana chichitambihwa nokutenda, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />ndava chinoitiwa chitsvene noshoko raMwari futi nomunamato.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muranda Adonaka waKhirisitu Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Kana ukaraira zvinhu zvakarezvi kuhama, unova mushumiri adonaka waKirisi tu Jesu, adorerehwa mumazvi yokutenda nodzidziso idonaka yaudotevera. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Siyana nozvinzano zvisinai umwari nonyaya dzoudzemwa dzochembere, uzvifundise kuva noumwari. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ndava kurovedza muviri kuno zvakunobatsira, asi kuva noumwari kunobatsira zvese, nokuti kuno zvidovimbisiwa muupenyu hwonguwa ino nohwonguwa inodzouya. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Kunyaira kwakareku kudotendeka, kunofanira kutambiriwa zvizere. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Ndosaka tichishanda nokushingirira, ndava tidoisa tariro yedu muna Mwari mupenyu, anova Muponisi wovanhu vese, kunyanyitsa wovanotenda.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Raira nokudzidzisa zvinhu zvakarezvi. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Mbakureke kuva nomunhu anozvidza udiki hwako, asi iva muenzaniso wovatendi pamatauriro, pamugariro, parudo, pakutenda nopakuchena. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Kusvika pandinouya, ramba uchiverenga magwaro paruzinji, pakukurudzira, nopakufundisa. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Reka kusaya hanya nochipo chaunacho, chaudopasiwa mukunyaira kwochiporofiti paudoturikiwa manja pamusoro novakuru vokherekhe. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Shingirira pakuita zvinhu zvakarezvi, uzvipire kwazviri, kuti vese vaone kubudirira kwako. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Zvichenjerere iwepa nozvaunodzidzisa, zvibatitsitse, ndava pakuita zvakarezvi zvichabatsira iwepa novanokunzva.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuva Nohanya Novatendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Reka kukaruza murume mukuru noukari, asi mukurudzire fanike zvaunoita baba vako, vochidiki vatore kunge vanin'ina vako, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />vanhukadzi vakuru uvaite fanike anamai, vanhukadzi vadiki fanike hanzvadzi, zvakarezvi mbazviitiwe muutsvene hwese.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Remekedza vajiche chaivo vochokwadi. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Asi kana mujiche anovana novazukuru, mbavathange kudzidza basa rochinamato kumhuri yavo norokudzotsera zvidonaka zvavadoitihwa novabereki vavo, ndava zvakarezvi ndizvo zvinofadza Mwari. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Mujiche chaiye, adosiiwa wega, nguyo adoisa tariro yache muna Mwari anoramba achikumbira kwaari nokunamata masikati nousiku, <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />asi mujiche anozviisa pakuzvifadza adopfa kare achiri mupuma daipo. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Varaire uchitsikimidza, kuti vareke kunyadzisa. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Kana munhu asingariritire hama dzache, kunyanyitsa vomumhuri yache, wakareyo wabirika mukutenda zvidokungudzirafuti kukunda asingatende. <verse eid="1TI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Mujiche mbaareke kuverengewa pabodzi novamwe vajiche kusiya kwokunge wava nomakore yasvika makumi matanhatu, mbaave uye wanga ari mukadzi womurume mubodzi, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />futi mbaavewo anopfakazihwa zvidonaka, adoyarutsa vana vache zvidonaka, anotambira varendo mumba mache, anoshambidza tsoka dzovatsvene, anobatsira vanotambudzika, pakare anozvipira kuita zvidonaka zvese.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Asi ramba kuisa muchiverengo vajiche vadiki, ndava kana vakundikana kugara vari vajiche vanodzoda kuroorewa, votadza kudzozvipira kuna Khirisitu, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />saka vanodzopasiwa mhosva yokuchora chivimbiso chavo chokuthanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Pamusoro pozvakarezvo, vanodzidza kundogara, vopedza nguwa vachikanza mudzimba, havaperere kundogara basi asi vaiti vomakuhwa vachinyaira zvavasingafanire. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Saka ndinototi vajiche vadiki mbavaroorewe, vaite vana, vochengeta dzimba dzavo, kuti varege kupasa muvengi mukana wokunyaira zvidoipa pamusoro pedu. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ndava vamwe vajiche vadototaika kare vachitevera Sathani. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Asi kana pano mukadzi mutendi anohama vajiche mbaavabatsire, kuti kherekhe ireke kupasiwa mutoro, kuti kherekhe ibatsire vajiche chaivo.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Vakuru vanotungamirira zvidonaka mbavapasiwe chiremera chidopetewa, kunyanyitsa vaye vanoita basa rokuparidza nokufundisa. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Ndava rugwaro rinoti, “Reka kusunga muromo wodhonza rinopura gorosi,” futi “Mushandi adokodzehwa nomuripo wache.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Reka kutetekera kupomehwa kunoitiwa mukuru kusiya kwokunge paita upfakazi hwovairi kana vatatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Vaye vanombondotadza, vadzume pamberi povese, kuti vamwe vagare vachicha. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ndinokutsindikira pamberi paMwari nopamberi paJesu Khirisitu nopongirozi dzitsvene kuti uteerere kuraira kwakareku usingaite zvotsvete kumunhu. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Reka kukurumidza kubata munhu pamusoro, kana kuva nochikamu pazvitadzo zvovamwe vanhu, zvichengete uri mutsvene.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Chireka kundomwa mvura basi, asi imwawo tuwaini tushoma kuti zvikubatsire mudumbu mako munombondokusvota.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Zvitadzo zvovamwe zvinooneka pachenu, futi zvinovakwevera kotongewa, asi zvitadzo zvovamwewo zvinodzooneka panguwa yopamberi. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Nzvibodzibodziwo nozviito zvidonaka zvinooneka pachenu, futi noizvo zvisinganatse kuoneka pachenu hazvirambe zvidosvisvika.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Vese vari pasi pouranda mbavazive kuti anatenzi vavo vanofanihwa nokuremekedzewa kwese, kuti zita raMwari nodzidziso yedu zvireke kushorewa. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Vaye vanoshandira anatenzi vanonamata, mbavareke kuvanyozera nondava yokuti vanonamata vese, asi vanotofanira kuvashandira zvidonyanyitsa kunaka ndava vakarevo vanobatsirika pabasa ravo mbatendi futi vadikani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Dzidziso Yomabhwodo Noupfumi Hwochokwadi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Udzidzise uchitsindikira mashandiro yakareya. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Kana umwewo munhu achidzidzisa zvinopesana nozvakarezvi, uye asingabvumirane nomazvi kwayo yaIshe Jesu Khirisitu nodzidziso inowirirana noumwari, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />wakareyo anosasuhwa nounyengeri, hapanai chaanoziva, iyeyo anoda kupesanisa nokuita nharo pamusoro pomashoko, zvinopasa chanje, kunyombana, nokufungirana zvidoipa, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />nokuramba panokukakavadzana pakati povanhu vanopfungwa dzidoora, vanga vasisiri kunzvitsitsa chokwadi ndokubva vaakufunga kuti umwari inzira yokuwana nayo upfumi.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Asi umwari pabodzi nokugutsikana ndiyo pfuma ikuru, <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />ndava hapanai chatidouya nacho panyika, saka hapanai chatinotorawo kubva kwairi. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Asi kana tino zvokuja nozvokusimira, tinogutsikana nazvo. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Vaye vokuda kupfuma vanowira mumiedzo, nomumiteyo, muzvido zvoudzemwa futi zvinokuwadza zvakarezvo zvinowisira vanhu mukupfukudzika nokuparadziwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ndava kuda mari ndomavambo yozvidoipa zvese, pakuiditsa vamwe vanhu vadotsambuka kubva pakutenda ndokuzvibaya mwoyo noshungu dzizinji.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rairo kuna Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Asi iwewe, munhu waMwari, nzvenga zvakarezvi zvese, tevera kururama, umwari, kutenda, rudo, kutsungirira nounyoro. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Ihwa kuhwa kudonaka kwokutenda, batitsitsa upenyu husingapere hwaudodaidzihwa paudopasa upfakazi hudonaka pamberi popfakazi dzidowanda. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ndinokuraira pamberi paMwari anopasa upenyu kuzvinhu zvese, nopamberi paKhirisitu Jesu adopasa upfakazi hudonaka pamberi paPondiyasi Pirato, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />kuti uchengete murairo wakareyu usinai dondorozi kana chinoshoreka kusvikira pakuoneka kwaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />kunova kuchaisiwa pachenu panguwa idofanira, naiye adoropafadziwa, iye wega Mutongi, Mambo womadzimambo naIshe womadzishe, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />iye wega asingapfe futi anogara pachiedza chisingasvikike, asinai kumboonewa nomunhu futi asingaoneke. Kwaari mbakuve nokuremekedzewa nomasimba nokusingapere. Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Raira vapfumi vomunyika yazvino, kuti vareke kuzvikudza kana kugurupira muupfumi husinai chokwadi, asi vaise tariro yavo muna Mwari anotipasa zvese zvinotinakira. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Vanofanira kuita zvidonaka, kuva vadopfuma pakuita zvidonaka, vave vadosununguka kupasa vamwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Mumaitiro yakareya vanozvichengetera upfumi senheyo idosimba youpenyu hunouya, kuti vabate upenyu chaihwo.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Iwewe Timoti chengetedza zvaudovimbiwa nazvo. Pira-gotsi kunyaira kusina umwari kuno kupesana kwavanoti izivo iyo yari mabhwodo. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Zvakarezvi zvinotauhwa novamwe, futi pakuita zvakarezvo vadotsambuka pakutenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Mutsa mbauve naimimi mese.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>